she hates raw vegetables.

265
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:56,260
Prepare for divine punishment.

266
00:15:56,260 --> 00:15:59,660
Are you crazy?! This is the finest 
feast anyone could ask for!

267
00:15:59,660 --> 00:16:00,460
Uh-huh...

268
00:16:00,930 --> 00:16:08,940
That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime

269
00:16:00,930 --> 00:16:08,940
Slime Diaries

270
00:16:01,390 --> 00:16:03,270
Milim, your sweet potato's cooked!

271
00:16:03,270 --> 00:16:05,380
I've been waiting for this!

272
00:16:06,210 --> 00:16:07,970
<i>Slime Diaries</i>!

273
00:16:15,950 --> 00:16:18,330
Sweet Potatoes

274
00:16:16,750 --> 00:16:18,080
Hey!

275
00:16:18,640 --> 00:16:20,450
The sweet potatoes are cooked!

276
00:16:20,680 --> 00:16:21,660
All right!

277
00:16:21,660 --> 00:16:23,350
Break time!

278
00:16:25,460 --> 00:16:26,540
Wow!

279
00:16:26,880 --> 00:16:28,910
I haven't had a roasted sweet potato in ages!

280
00:16:28,910 --> 00:16:31,640
Who knew we could raise sweet 
potatoes ourselves, huh?

281
00:16:31,640 --> 00:16:32,620
It's so good!

282
00:16:32,620 --> 00:16:34,380
So good!

283
00:16:38,730 --> 00:16:40,390
Want some, Master?

284
00:16:47,210 --> 00:16:50,450
<i>Master's been acting kinda weird lately.</i>

285
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:53,960
<i>His eyes seem to go distant at random times,</i>

286
00:16:53,960 --> 00:16:56,910
<i>and he just stands and stares 
at the falling leaves...</i>

287
00:16:59,100 --> 00:17:04,700
<i>I have no idea what his past 
as a swordsman was like.</i>

288
00:17:07,580 --> 00:17:11,410
<i>But every time I see his 
back when he's like this...</i>

289
00:17:14,420 --> 00:17:15,680
<i>I can't stop myself!</i>

290
00:17:22,770 --> 00:17:25,640
Punishment

291
00:17:28,810 --> 00:17:32,820
Sweet Potatoes

292
00:17:29,080 --> 00:17:31,640
Hey, we just thought you were going senile...

293
00:17:31,640 --> 00:17:32,820
Y-Yeah.

294
00:17:33,220 --> 00:17:35,570
I am very much all here, thank you.

295
00:17:36,460 --> 00:17:38,570
Would you care to try again?

296
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:53,050
I don't have the time 
to spare them a thought.

297
00:17:57,040 --> 00:17:58,430
Everyone!

298
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:01,310
Great Rimuru has sent snacks for all of you.

299
00:18:04,570 --> 00:18:07,600
How gracious of him to think of us...

300
00:18:05,050 --> 00:18:07,290
Go on, eat up!

301
00:18:07,290 --> 00:18:08,580
It's so soft and sweet!

302
00:18:08,030 --> 00:18:12,440
We've already given the children 
theirs, so help yourselves.

303
00:18:08,580 --> 00:18:09,710
How great it is to have bountiful land.

304
00:18:09,710 --> 00:18:12,440
Yes, we must take good care of it.

305
00:18:14,150 --> 00:18:16,690
Sir Geld, what's the matter?

306
00:18:16,690 --> 00:18:19,520
Don't worry about me. Go ahead and eat.

307
00:18:29,490 --> 00:18:30,750
Sir Geld.

308
00:18:32,290 --> 00:18:34,320
Let's all eat together.

309
00:18:37,560 --> 00:18:38,410
Yes.

310
00:18:42,450 --> 00:18:45,090
Eat well and grow strong.

311
00:18:46,260 --> 00:18:48,830
Share your joy and grow strong.

312
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:54,120
We sure got a lot.

313
00:18:54,120 --> 00:18:55,230
Impressive!

314
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:06,680
Looks like this year's harvest 
is going to end pretty well.

315
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:08,520
Guess we have you to thank, Treyni-san.

316
00:19:08,520 --> 00:19:10,460
I only offered some advice.

317
00:19:10,730 --> 00:19:14,230
To first think for yourselves 
and learn how to plan...

318
00:19:14,770 --> 00:19:16,550
That was the promise.

319
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:18,080
I guess so.

320
00:19:19,970 --> 00:19:22,820
Well, now that the harvest is complete,

321
00:19:23,340 --> 00:19:26,490
there is no further work for me to do here.

322
00:19:26,490 --> 00:19:27,310
Huh?

323
00:19:27,910 --> 00:19:28,890
I believe...

324
00:19:29,620 --> 00:19:32,680
you all can take care 
of the rest on your own.

325
00:19:36,020 --> 00:19:40,460
Great Rimuru, until we meet again.

326
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:52,410
No way... That was so sudden...

327
00:19:52,410 --> 00:19:54,280
Oh, Great Rimuru?

328
00:19:54,280 --> 00:19:55,670
Is something wrong?

329
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:58,120
Hey, just a second ago, there was...

330
00:20:00,460 --> 00:20:02,730
Nah, it's nothing.

331
00:20:04,880 --> 00:20:08,520
<i>You're right. We'll meet again someday.</i>

332
00:20:08,520 --> 00:20:11,110
<i>Thanks, Treyni-san.</i>

333
00:20:19,940 --> 00:20:22,650
There's no way she'll be here, huh?

334
00:20:26,120 --> 00:20:27,200
Welcome!

335
00:20:27,670 --> 00:20:29,470
Ah, welcome.

336
00:20:29,470 --> 00:20:30,790
You <i>are</i> here!

337
00:20:31,050 --> 00:20:32,500
Jeez, again with this!

338
00:20:32,500 --> 00:20:35,480
What? I returned to prepare the potatoes.

339
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:37,300
We just fried them up!

340
00:20:38,290 --> 00:20:40,940
Would you like one, Great Rimuru?

341
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:21,980
This place is great. 
There's so much good food!

342
00:22:23,330 --> 00:22:25,230
That's right. It is amazing.

343
00:22:25,470 --> 00:22:29,130
It's the result of the effort 
put in by each of the citizens.

344
00:22:29,130 --> 00:22:30,740
Be more modest, Shion.

345
00:22:30,910 --> 00:22:32,400
That's right, One Horn!

346
00:22:32,400 --> 00:22:33,780
It's Shion.

347
00:22:33,780 --> 00:22:34,680
Yeah, that!

348
00:22:34,680 --> 00:22:37,440
Now, we should get out before we get dizzy.

349
00:22:40,900 --> 00:22:41,920
By the way...

350
00:22:42,520 --> 00:22:46,670
I'm testing out a new dessert made 
with chestnuts and sweet potatoes.

351
00:22:46,840 --> 00:22:49,320
What?! I wanna eat it!

352
00:22:49,320 --> 00:22:53,210
Dessert so late at night? How sinful!

353
00:22:53,210 --> 00:22:54,010
Oh?

354
00:22:57,770 --> 00:23:01,770
Try not to
eat too much

355
00:23:06,110 --> 00:23:09,400
I mean... I thought girls worried 
about that sort of thing!

356
00:23:09,400 --> 00:23:13,250
I was trying to help! Okay? Okay? Okay?!

357
00:23:13,250 --> 00:23:15,410
Please don't be mad!

358
00:23:17,430 --> 00:23:19,900
<i>Enjoy the flavors of autumn in moderation.</i>

359
00:23:20,960 --> 00:23:40,980
Preview

360
00:23:21,980 --> 00:23:25,020
I actually never gain any weight!

361
00:23:25,020 --> 00:23:25,710
Yep!

362
00:23:25,860 --> 00:23:29,330
Nor do I. All nutrients 
go straight to my chest!

363
00:23:31,130 --> 00:23:34,260
I guess the League of Sweets 
is permanently disbanded.

364
00:23:36,990 --> 00:23:40,000
N-Next time, "The Arrival of Winter."

